# A box with a pet inside comes out of a capsule: the machine steps aside and you rip it open
# right there (the boxes tab is still locked), then it's back to the lever.
from after_tutorial
view full
tab machine
next-prize pet_box
pull 1 0.5
shot box_out
wait 0.8
shot box_landed
expect fits
key space
wait ritual
shot result
expect fits
expect no-text "open another"
click "lovely!"
wait 0.4
shot back_to_machine
expect fits
